  "description": "Framework-agnostic core for gRPC assertions in .NET test projects. Provides the GrpcCallBuilder test-double helper (Success and Faulted AsyncUnaryCall builders), gRPC outcome rendering for failure messages, and RpcException predicates, over the single Grpc.Core.Api dependency (the RpcException / StatusCode / Status types the assertions are about). Test-framework-specific assertion entry points live in adapter packages (GrpcAssertions.TUnit ships today; xUnit, NUnit, MSTest adapters are possible if there is demand). AOT-compatible, trimmable, no runtime reflection.",
  "id": "GrpcAssertions",
